# Pairs with NoStaleAuthority. A writer that crashed after committing and
# before publishing is covered only by every survivor treating its snapshot as
# out of date when membership declares it dead; the mutant skips that.
MODULE: DeclareDeadNoInvalidate
TARGET: NoStaleAuthority
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: membership declaring a silo dead does not invalidate surviving snapshots
PERTURBS: DeclareDead
BOUNDS: MaxCrashes = 1

--- FIND
    /\ stale' = [t \in Silos |-> stale[t] \/ alive[t]]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: survivors are not invalidated.
    /\ stale' = stale
--- END
